# Router Solicitation (ICMPv6 type 133, RFC 4861 section 4.1) as the probe sends it to
# ff02::2: checksum 0 (the kernel fills it on a raw ICMPv6 socket), four reserved octets, and
# the source link-layer address 00:00:5e:00:53:01. It is not an advertisement.
#
# type 133, code 0, checksum 0
85 00 00 00
# reserved
00 00 00 00
# option 1, source link-layer address, 1 unit
01 01 00 00 5e 00 53 01
